   "file": "TauCeti/Algebra/MonoidAlgebra/Frobenius.lean",
   "fix": "Rename it to `isReduced_iff_forall_pow_eq_one_imp_eq_one`. Alternatively, state the right-hand side as `Function.Injective fun g : G \u21a6 g ^ p` and call it `isReduced_iff_pow_injective`, to match its sibling `isReduced_iff_isReduced_and_pow_injective`. Update the docstring list and both call sites in `SmoothConnected.lean`.",
   "issue": "The name `isReduced_iff_forall_pow_eq_one` describes `\u2200 g, g ^ p = 1`, which is a much stronger condition than the actual right-hand side `\u2200 g : G, g ^ p = 1 \u2192 g = 1` (no `p`-torsion). The module docstring entry at line 50 and the callers in `SmoothConnected.lean` inherit the misleading name.",
